    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0 @4xl:col-span-7">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">One call, one ordering</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-vx-ink/80">
        A sample call and its result. Equal weights keep the order you gave, so asking again with the same answers
        returns the same ranking.
      </p>
      <pre class="mono mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-vx-ink bg-vx-ink p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-vx-cream" aria-label="A sample rank_options call and its result"><code>{deciderSample}</code></pre>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-vx-ink/75">
        The contract, with every limit, is in <a class="underline" href="https://github.com/Vulnetix/belai/blob/main/docs/pix-sandbox.md#the-decider-mcp">docs/pix-sandbox.md</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
